projects.description:
a)	Construction and provision of technical support to Maize mill business group;
b)	Provision of technical support to feed making group;
c)	Provision of technical support to Mushroom group;
d)	Provision of technical support to meat processing groups;
e)	Facilitation of access to markets for business groups to create self employment;
f)	Provision of technical support to bakery business participants;
g)	Provision of technical support to value added milk processing groups(production of yoghurt);
h)	Provision of technical support and startup materials to peanut butter processing group;
i)	Provision of technical support and materials to hair dressing group
j)	Provision of technical support towards establishment of VSLs

Four specific objectives:
1.	 to support Malawi in developing and/or strengthening and implementing national strategies, plans or policies against trafficking in persons;
2.	to bring its national legal frameworks in compliance with international standards;  
3.	to strengthen its criminal justice response to trafficking in persons, including through regional cooperation in criminal matters related to trafficking in persons, following a victim centred-approach; and 
4.	to strengthen victim protection and assistance.
